      ],
      "title": "音乐力量·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "31035001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "嗯哼~我就知道——你们离不开我的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "萝贝卡，你怎么来了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "趁着真恋和卡缪还在竞拍，我先把卡缪抢走的唱片抢回来~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "那你为什么要拎着工具箱呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我、我愿意！这可是|101|给我的，万一被其他人偷走了怎么办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "那就请喵爪帮专业修理师，帮忙救治一下这里受伤的手办？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "那我就勉为其难帮帮你们吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "大嗓门音乐家",
          "text": "谢谢你，修好了我们！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31035009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "还有一个……哎？你是吃掉贝斯的那个！噪音鸡！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "叽叽叫",
          "text": "呜……贝斯卡住了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "我的贝斯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "克莱儿，我找到了你的贝斯，但……貌似拿不出来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "是有点难度——要不我把他整个拆开……哎呦，干嘛打我嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "先看看能不能把贝斯拽出来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "好，我试试……唔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "叽叽叫",
          "text": "唔唔唔唔！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31036008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我也来帮忙！嘿咻嘿咻~耶！出来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31037001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "接下来，我们这样这样……这就是合奏，大家理解了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31037002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "大嗓门音乐家",
          "text": "呱！我知道了，就是该张嘴张嘴，不该张嘴的时候假装张嘴！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31037003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "很好，那一会大家都别忘记了自己的站位喔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31037004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "我们快过去吧，真恋那边不知道怎么样了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31037005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "大小姐一定很想我！嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
